  "text": "Necromancy Raksha\n\n​\nIntroduction\nThis is an advanced guide which assumes a strong underlying knowledge of all mechanics and information presented in #raksha-basic.\n​\nPresets and Relics\n⬥ Necromancy\n\n⬥ Drink  to upkeep  special attack\n⬥  is used to perform the 0 tick switch\n⬥ T100  weapons are not required but will make the guide more consistent\n⬥ Optionally switch to  p4 after  proc if seeking a PB\n​\nRotation\nPre-build\nBuild 5  and 4  stacks at  dummies\n​\nInside Instance\n →  → \n​\nPhase 1\n +  →  →  +  under  → tc +  →  →  →  →  →  →  → \n​\nPhase 2\n +  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  →  → improvise basics if not phased\n​\nPhase 3\n →  →  →  →  →  →  + target pools →  → target  + \n​\nPhase 4\n →  →  →  → equip  → equip  +  →  →  →  →  →  +    (0 tick) →  →  →  →  →   →  →  →  →  →  →  →   → improvise if not dead\n​\nNote: check !0tick ‎for information about \"(0 tick)\"\n​\nExample Kill\n⬥ Necromancy \n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "Necromancy Raksha ​ Introduction This is an advanced guide which assumes a strong underlying knowledge of all mechanics and information presented in #raksha-basic. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Necromancy ⬥ Drink to upkeep special attack ⬥ is used to perform the 0 tick switch ⬥ T100 weapons are not required but will make the guide more consistent ⬥ Optionally switch to p4 after proc if seeking a PB ​ Rotation Pre-build Build 5 and 4 stacks at dummies ​ Inside Instance → → ​ Phase 1 + → → + under → tc + → → → → → → → ​ Phase 2 + → → → → → → → → → → → → → improvise basics if not phased ​ Phase 3 → → → → → → + target pools → → target + ​ Phase 4 → → → → equip → equip + → → → → → + (0 tick) → → → → → → → → → → → → → improvise if not dead ​ Note: check !0tick ‎for information about \"(0 tick)\" ​ Example Kill ⬥ Necromancy ​",
